+ const r=drive(d,{steps:{0:['Activate · '+F],1:['@'+F+'>Chain · '+IMPERM,'Spell / Trap zone 1','pick:'+F]},onPrompt,until:dd=>stopAtIdle(dd)&&++idle===2});
+ assert.ok(r.stopped&&!r.unused[0].length&&!r.unused[1].length,tag+' ran: '+JSON.stringify(r));
+ const after=new Set(w.after);assert.ok(![F,U,O].some(n=>after.has(n)),tag+': a Trap (Imperm) triggers no Fenrir/Unicorn/Ogre punish: '+[...after]);
+ if(tag==='K2')assert.ok(after.has(PREP+' (trigger)'),'K2: face-up Preparations punishes the Trap after the chain: '+[...after]);
+ else assert.ok(!after.has(PREP+' (trigger)'),'K2b: a face-down Preparations does not punish');
+ results[tag]={during:[...new Set(w.during)],after:[...after]};d.stop()}
